## 4. Step-by-Step Technical Execution

### Step 1: Document Access Restriction Verification
Pre-assessment checks on the target documents confirmed active access control restrictions. Attempting to open `My Locked PDF3.pdf` presented a standard authorization challenge, blocking document inspection without valid credentials.

### Step 2: Extraction Interface Ingestion
The locked files were ingested into the parsing portal (`onlinehashcrack.com`) to inspect document headers and extract the `$pdf$` hash structure.

### Step 3: Isolating Cryptographic Hash Signatures
The parsing engine produced standardized hash digests. Each digest was verified to ensure the string began with `$pdf$` without corrupting leading or trailing characters.
